/-! # Verdier exchange on constructible finite-Tor complexes

Source: latest blueprint sec-six-functors/sk-thm-sf-verdier-exchange/_section.md,
the four exchanges, their three specializations, and the Complement
(blueprint: sk-thm-sf-verdier-exchange).

All arrows below are fixed by the published ctf adjunctions, projection,
compositor and signed evaluation. The theorem supplies invertibility and
comparison equations; it does not quantify over unspecified operations.
-/

@[expose] public noncomputable section
set_option autoImplicit false
